<title>QATAR: Qatar International Islamic lifts net, div flat.</title>
<headline>Qatar International Islamic lifts net, div flat.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	     (million Qatari riyals, rounded)</p>
<p> Net profit			14.2   vs	11.1</p>
<p> Total income		    66.0   vs	54.5</p>
<p> Total expenses		  18.8   vs	15.9</p>
<p>Customers' share in total</p>
<p>			income     32.9   vs	27.2</p>
<p> Total dividend		   3.5   vs	same</p>
<p> Total assets		 1,095.7   vs     864.7</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds	   81.7   vs	71.5</p>
<p>Full name: Qatar International Islamic Bank.</p>
<p>Note: QIIB shares are traded on Qatar's unofficial stock market.</p>
</text>
